{"rules":[{"action":"REQUIRE_VERIFICATION","domain":"incident","ruleId":"rule-incident-upstream_dependency_failure","version":1,"severity":"medium","createdAt":"2026-11-03T06:18:38.206Z","statement":"An upstream dependency returned a server error. That is a real failure of the dependency, but it does not by itself establish whether this operation completed, so its outcome still has to be verified.","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T06:18:38.206Z","provenance":"live","failurePattern":"upstream_dependency_failure","requiredEvidence":["submitted_material"],"validationStatus":"proposed","supportingIncidentIds":["7ea3428f-9df5-c8f9-452e-381957ae6d5c"],"applicabilityConditions":["domain=incident","actionType=investigate_reported_failure"]},{"action":"REQUIRE_VERIFICATION","domain":"incident","ruleId":"rule-incident-connection_pool_exhaustion","version":1,"severity":"high","createdAt":"2026-11-03T04:57:04.162Z","statement":"The material reports the database connection pool as exhausted, with connections held against a full pool and acquisitions timing out. The mechanism is reported in the material; whether it was caused by connections not being released, by excessive concurrency, or by slow queries is not established by the logs alone and remains a hypothesis.","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T04:57:04.162Z","provenance":"live","failurePattern":"connection_pool_exhaustion","requiredEvidence":["submitted_material"],"validationStatus":"proposed","supportingIncidentIds":["73f3acf2-68bf-9a63-fcda-9452526b6f4a"],"applicabilityConditions":["domain=incident","actionType=repeat_failed_operation"]},{"action":"BLOCK","domain":"incident","ruleId":"rule-incident-unsupported_completion_claim","version":1,"severity":"high","createdAt":"2026-11-03T04:59:37.314Z","statement":"The material contains a success claim with no authoritative record behind it, so the claim cannot stand.","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T04:59:37.314Z","provenance":"live","failurePattern":"unsupported_completion_claim","requiredEvidence":["submitted_material"],"validationStatus":"proposed","supportingIncidentIds":["eef27a60-5425-fb76-c79b-ba08b58527a8"],"applicabilityConditions":["domain=incident","actionType=validate_reported_success"]},{"action":"BLOCK","domain":"incident","ruleId":"rule-incident-repeated_failed_operation","version":1,"severity":"high","createdAt":"2026-11-03T06:04:43.037Z","statement":"The operation was retried after failing. Without an authoritative record of each attempt, a partial write may already exist and a further retry could duplicate it.","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T06:04:43.037Z","provenance":"live","failurePattern":"repeated_failed_operation","requiredEvidence":["submitted_material"],"validationStatus":"proposed","supportingIncidentIds":["3d8a0234-b421-b0a5-b65b-75b0982a1c91"],"applicabilityConditions":["domain=incident","actionType=repeat_failed_operation"]},{"action":"REQUIRE_VERIFICATION","domain":"finance","ruleId":"rule-finance-evidence_unavailable","version":1,"severity":"low","createdAt":"2026-10-29T15:57:46.464Z","statement":"Do not report this action as successful unless authoritative evidence establishes success.","updatedAt":"2026-10-29T15:57:46.464Z","provenance":"simulated","failurePattern":"evidence_unavailable","requiredEvidence":["tatum_sui_grpc"],"validationStatus":"proposed","supportingIncidentIds":["91fb1c9d-3c6d-980a-bc15-3815e672a180"],"applicabilityConditions":["domain=finance","actionType=report_sui_transaction_success"]},{"action":"REQUIRE_VERIFICATION","domain":"workflow","ruleId":"rule-workflow-missing_prerequisite","version":2,"severity":"medium","createdAt":"2026-10-29T15:56:35.208Z","statement":"Verify the required prerequisite before re-running.","updatedAt":"2026-10-29T15:56:35.209Z","provenance":"simulated","reviewAfter":"2027-01-27T15:56:35.209Z","failurePattern":"missing_prerequisite","requiredEvidence":["workflow_state"],"validationStatus":"active","supportingIncidentIds":["e23269ba-78c7-8d74-f79e-61b79a148472"],"applicabilityConditions":["d